        <fullName>Business_Relationship__c</fullName>
        <inlineHelpText>Current = Client is trading as of January 1 of current year.
Inactive (No Recent Trading) = Client has not traded in the 12 months prior to January 1 of current year.
New Logo (Never Traded) = Client has never traded as of January 1 of current year.</inlineHelpText>
